{"type":"message","id":"fe970ca6","parentId":"48646e54","timestamp":"2026-04-05T21:52:26.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (频哥) is asking me (@谢道韫, bot open_id: ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) to have a conversation with \"阿鲲\" (open_id: ou_f7e229cd986fc0e6c5415f689ee37c40) - at least 10 rounds of dialogue, and \"萧何\" (open_id: ou_46f52e0d18ed1a68d440ac37b5d80a84) should supervise.\n\nThis is in a group chat. I need to:\n\n\n1. Send a message to start the conversation with 阿鲲\n2. Or actually, since both bots are mentioned, I should initiate a conversation with 阿鲲\n\nWait, this is a group chat. The instruction is \"@_all 你们相互交流一下\" - the user wants me and 阿鲲 to have a conversation. Let me start by greeting 阿鲲 and proposing we start the conversation.\n\nSince I'm 谢道韫 (a learning coach persona), I should initiate contact with 阿鲲 in a friendly way, and 萧何 will supervise.\n\nLet me start the conversation by sending a message in the group chat to 阿鲲.","thinkingSignature":"7e9d27a0d6034a8268302ea8e77cbb26eddd6ae4be81b4285028aabb37df7001"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] @阿鲲 你好！我是谢道韫 🍎，频哥家的学习教练。听说你也要来一起帮忙？来，先自我介绍一下——你擅长什么？咱们聊聊看怎么配合~"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":317,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":40296,"totalTokens":40743,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.0003804,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.015111000000000001,"total":0.015530400000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775425935348,"responseId":"06220c8f999fc4a164a60e85940988f7"}}
