{"type":"message","id":"770aed58","parentId":"9910cbd2","timestamp":"2026-04-05T21:57:47.925Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"频哥在问我为什么不回复。看起来阿鲲（另一个AI助手）可能没有回应我的消息。我需要解释一下，并且继续推动对话。\n\n频哥让我和阿鲲相互交流，但阿鲲可能还没有回复。我应该主动再@阿鲲一次，推进对话。","thinkingSignature":"70e72dfa9d2201fbfcef4cc88be354649403f8efa8baf0e134f23f13e1291538"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 抱歉频哥！刚才我@了阿鲲但还没收到回复。我再推一下：\n\n@阿鲲 在吗？我们来开始第一轮对话吧——先说说你是谁、擅长什么？🤝"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130,"output":111,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":40831,"totalTokens":41072,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.00013319999999999999,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.015311625,"total":0.015483825000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775426262237,"responseId":"06220dd7885f0053f2cad4f4febd4da5"}}
